    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SnaiL TraiL</strong> is an arcade action-platformer packed with humor and chaotic battles. Use the environment, collect power-ups, grab a weapon \u2014 and squeeze every drop of maneuverability from your slippery shell! It's not about speed, it's about strategy, reflexes, and good old snail swagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget the co-op mode: invite your friend via Remote Play \u2014 because everything\u2019s better with a buddy (and no, we\u2019re not saying you don\u2019t have any. Promise!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core gameplay features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slippery, momentum-based movement with trajectory control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique attacks tied to different types of weaponry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels filled with dynamic traps and interactive elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op via Remote Play Together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes it stand out:</strong> <i>SnaiL TraiL</i> combines absurd humor, tight action, and the undeniable charm of armored snails. Easy to pick up, hard to put down \u2014 especially when shouting tactics (or nonsense) with friends mid-slime-battle. Perfect for game nights, streams, or unapologetic chaos sessions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SnaiL TraiL</strong> is an arcade action-platformer packed with humor and chaotic battles. Use the environment, collect power-ups, grab a weapon \u2014 and squeeze every drop of maneuverability from your slippery shell! It's not about speed, it's about strategy, reflexes, and good old snail swagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget the co-op mode: invite your friend via Remote Play \u2014 because everything\u2019s better with a buddy (and no, we\u2019re not saying you don\u2019t have any. Promise!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core gameplay features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slippery, momentum-based movement with trajectory control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique attacks tied to different types of weaponry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels filled with dynamic traps and interactive elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op via Remote Play Together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes it stand out:</strong> <i>SnaiL TraiL</i> combines absurd humor, tight action, and the undeniable charm of armored snails. Easy to pick up, hard to put down \u2014 especially when shouting tactics (or nonsense) with friends mid-slime-battle. Perfect for game nights, streams, or unapologetic chaos sessions.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cSnaiL TraiL\u201d is a wild co-op action game where armored snails battle for survival, leaving behind more than just slime \u2014 they spread pure chaos. Play solo or team up, slide, shoot, and prove that speed means nothing when you're a snail with attitude.A GAMEPAD is required for a cooperative game.",
